      "cooked": "<p>I didn't get a new Sentinel group character card in my package of VotM. &nbsp;Did they get a new character card with the new incap powers or did GotG accidentially not ship it with my package?</p><p>I wasn't sure at first, but then when I looked at the Sentinels, I realized they have 5 character cards, the 4 members, and a team one with their incap powers on the back. &nbsp;So in VotM, I have the 4 members, but not the team one. &nbsp;Also, my copy of the Sentinels members' have no text on the incap side, where as the original versions said incap (but the powers were still on the team card).</p>",
